these in their lunch boxes.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.299
- This is something where
I'm like,"Oh I like this."

00:02:08.299 --> 00:02:09.438
Is this the best thing I've ever eaten?

00:02:09.438 --> 00:02:11.515
No, but if you tried
to take it away from me

00:02:11.515 --> 00:02:12.433
I would kill you.

00:02:12.433 --> 00:02:13.859
- I think all southern food feels like

00:02:13.859 --> 00:02:15.380
