00:02:19.376 --> 00:02:20.420
- You're worried about your arteries.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.975
- California needs to
step it up a little bit.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:22.451
- I know.

00:02:22.451 --> 00:02:23.194
We're like--

00:02:23.194 --> 00:02:24.413
Everything that we're doing is like,

00:02:24.413 --> 00:02:25.494
