00:02:25.494 --> 00:02:26.154
(bleep) that.

00:02:26.154 --> 00:02:27.177
Give me sugar ham.

00:02:27.177 --> 00:02:27.816
- Yeah.

00:02:27.816 --> 00:02:29.916
- I think southern food makes
you happy while you eat it,

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.252
and then right afterwards you're like,

00:02:31.252 --> 00:02:32.796
